<link href="{{ 'section-multicolumn.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<link href="{{ 'section-testimonials.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<link href="{{ 'component-rte.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />

<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'component-slider.css' | asset_url }}" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<style data-shopify>.section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: 27px;
    padding-bottom: 27px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: 36px;
      padding-bottom: 36px;
    }
  }</style><div class="multicolumn color-background-1 gradient background-primary">
  <div class="page-width section-{{ section.id }}-padding isolate"><div class="title-wrapper-with-link title-wrapper--self-padded-mobile title-wrapper--no-top-margin">
        <h2 class="title h1">
          Real Ingredients, Real Results
        </h2></div>
    <slider-component class="slider-mobile-gutter">
      <ul
        class="multicolumn-list contains-content-container grid grid--1-col-tablet-down grid--3-col-desktop slider slider--mobile grid--peek"
        id="Slider-{{ section.id }}"
        role="list"
      >
          

          <li
            id="Slide-{{ section.id }}-1"
            class="multicolumn-list__item grid__item center"
            
          >
            <div class="multicolumn-card content-container testimonial-card"><div class="multicolumn-card__info"><p class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</p><div class="testimonial-card__quotes testimonial-card__quotes--image-blank">
                    <img
                      src="{{ 'quotes.png' | asset_url }}"
                      alt="''"
                    >
                  </div><h3>Finally found a magnesium that works for me as a women.</h3><div class="rte"><p>"I love that this isn’t just basic magnesium. It has D3, K2, B vitamins, ashwagandha, and more all in one. It fits easily into my daily routine, and I feel like I’m giving my body more complete support without taking a bunch of different supplements."</p></div><div class="testimonial-card__author-container"><p class="testimonial-card__author">
                        Michelle R.
                      </p></div></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          

          <li
            id="Slide-{{ section.id }}-2"
            class="multicolumn-list__item grid__item center"
            
          >
            <div class="multicolumn-card content-container testimonial-card"><div class="multicolumn-card__info"><p class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</p><div class="testimonial-card__quotes testimonial-card__quotes--image-blank">
                    <img
                      src="{{ 'quotes.png' | asset_url }}"
                      alt="''"
                    >
                  </div><h3>Perfect for my daily wellness routine.</h3><div class="rte"><p>"I started taking this because I wanted something to support relaxation, muscle function, and overall balance. The capsules are easy to take, and I like that it’s non-GMO, filler-free, and made without gluten, soy, dairy, or tree nuts. Definitely a staple in my routine now."</p></div><div class="testimonial-card__author-container"><p class="testimonial-card__author">
                        Rachel T.
                      </p></div></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          

          <li
            id="Slide-{{ section.id }}-3"
            class="multicolumn-list__item grid__item center"
            
          >
            <div class="multicolumn-card content-container testimonial-card"><div class="multicolumn-card__info"><p class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</p><div class="testimonial-card__quotes testimonial-card__quotes--image-blank">
                    <img
                      src="{{ 'quotes.png' | asset_url }}"
                      alt="''"
                    >
                  </div><h3>Simple but works great</h3><div class="rte"><p>"The 240-capsule bottle is such a good deal, especially since it lasts 4 months. I also really like that it’s made specifically for women with ingredients like biotin, folate, myo-inositol, and ashwagandha. Simple, clean, and easy to stay consistent with."</p></div><div class="testimonial-card__author-container"><p class="testimonial-card__author">
                        Lily M.
                      </p></div></div>
            </div>
          </li></ul><div class="slider-buttons no-js-hidden medium-hide">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="slider-button slider-button--prev"
            name="previous"
            aria-label="Slide left"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

          </button>
          <div class="slider-counter caption">
            <span class="slider-counter--current">1</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">of</span>
            <span class="slider-counter--total">3</span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="slider-button slider-button--next"
            name="next"
            aria-label="Slide right"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

          </button>
        </div></slider-component>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Magnesium testimonials",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
